[DTHKMKSpecPistol]
DeathStrings=("%o's escape velocity was pitiful compared to the .45HV bullets that %k's slinging.","%k took out the prime suspect, %o, with several bullets to the kidneys.","%o won't be running from the law anymore, or living at all thanks to %k.","%k tore into %o's ankles with some very speedy .45 bullets.","%o not only had their body armor pierced, but their lungs as well due to taking %k's bullets.","%k blew through %o's armor like a laser cutter through butter.")
