MaleSuicide="%o prosecuted himself with the HKM-26."

[DTHKMKSpecPistolAlt]
DeathStrings=("%o's rib cage has some vacancy now that %k cleared it out with some buckshot.","%k might've had no bullets in the mag, but a single shotgun shell buried %o.","%o had their armor compromised, now they’re finished off by %k's shotgun from their HKM.","%k's HKM mangled %o's shooting hand with some 00 Buckshot.","%o took a lungful of %k's buckshot from their baby shotgun.")
