MaleSuicide="%o litigated his own head off."

[DTHKMKSpecPistolHeadAlt]
DeathStrings=("%o had their mugshot taken by %k, giving them a literal mug shot.","%k destroyed %o's face so viciously that it doesn’t match their wanted poster.","%o didn't feel so lucky when they assumed that %k's mag was empty. Boom, headshot.","%k's HKM took a bite out of crime and %o's face with a small shottie.","%o found out the hard way that staring down %k's shotgun would leave them blind and dead.")
DeathString="%k put %kh HKM-26 to %o's temple and fired."
FemaleSuicide="%o litigated her own head off."
MaleSuicide="%o litigated his own head off."

