DeathStrings=("%o thought %ve could avoid one rocket, but %ve couldn't avoid %k's six rocket storm.","%k's Multi-barreled Hydra slayed the warrior %o with an explosive barrage.","%o found out that %k's launcher Hydra is versatile in exploding enemies in many ways.","%k might’ve missed with one rocket, but a couple more reduced %o into a light mist.","%o was the willing assistant, disappearing in a cloud because of %k's explosive magic show.","%k brought down multiple rockets unto %o, who couldn't accept them all.")
