DeathStrings=("%o couldn't keep track which form %k's Chimera was in and got a hole for %vh troubles.","%k managed to pop %o's spleen from a mile and a half away.","%o failed to see %k's bullet headed right towards %vm and died as a result.","%k didn't need to amp up the Chimera to put %o in the grave.","%o had %vh toes fed to %k's Chimera.","%k took off %o's middle finger after getting flipped off.")
