DeathStrings=("%o got some unwanted tracheotomy from %k's sniper rifle.","%k adapted to the situation and sniped off %o's head.","%o failed to see the glint of %k's Chimera and got a bullet to the eye.","%k's Chimera was a carnivore and took a bite out of %o's brains.","%o took %k's .338 to the teeth, shattering the cavities to pieces.","%k had no reason to amp %kh rifle to nail %o right between the eyes.")
