DeathStrings=("%o was purged in the fire of %k's Chimera without even seeing them.","%k can now see %o from a mile away thanks to some fiery bullets.","%o had %vh heart roasted by %k's modular rifle.","%k reduced %o's kneecaps into ashes from well placed shots with a fiery Chimera.","%o not only failed to save the princess, but was burned to cinders by %k.","%k lit up %o while abiding by the 6 feet rule.")
