DeathString="%o bled to death from %k's fragmented wrench shot."
FemaleSuicide="%o doesn't know how to aim."
MaleSuicide="%o can't aim very well."

[DTWrenchgunMelee]
DeathStrings=("%k wrench-pummeled %o with %kh wrenchgun wrench bayonet.","%o was wrenched down by %k's wrenchgun wrench.","%k's wrenchgun wrenched a couple of %o's ribs.")
DeathString="%k wrench-pummeled %o with %kh wrenchgun wrench bayonet."
FemaleSuicide="%o bashed herself with the wrenchgun."
MaleSuicide="%o headbutted his wrenchgun."

[DTWrenchgunMeleeHead]
DeathStrings=("%k wrenched %kh wrenchgun wrench bayonet into %o's teeth.","%o fell as %k's wrenchgun wrench bayonet crushed %vh face.","%k cracked %o's skull with %kh trusty wrenchgun.","%k's wrenchgun wrench bayonet wrenched %o's head.")
DeathString="%k smashed %kh wrenchgun wrench bayonet into %o's teeth."
FemaleSuicide="%o swatted a fly on her own brain."
MaleSuicide="%o put his eye out with a wrenchgun wrench bayonet."

[DTWrenchgunShot]
DeathStrings=("%k redefined terminal velocity by fatally lobbing a wrench at %o.","%o proved to be no match for %k's patented flying wrench technique.","%o mistakenly brought a gun to %k's ballistic wrench fight.")
SimpleKillString="Redwood Wrenchgun Wrenchshot"
DeathString="%k hunted down a cowering %o with %kh wrenchgun."
FemaleSuicide="%o doesn't know how to aim."
MaleSuicide="%o can't aim very well."

[DTWrenchgunShotHead]
DeathStrings=("%k's high velocity wrench shattered %o's non-wrench proof skull.","%k masterfully shot a wrench into %o's face.","%o fondly remembers a time when %k's wrench wasn't lodged in their skull.")

[DTX8KnifeMGLaunched]
DeathStrings=("%o never saw %k's small ballistic knife on %kh big PKMA.","%k showed %o it's not the size that matters, it's how you use it.","%o mistakenly brought a gun to %k's ballistic knife fight, again.")
SimpleKillString="PKMA - X8 Ballistic Knife"
DeathString="%k showed %o how in %kh country, KNIFE SHOOTS YOU."
FemaleSuicide="%o played Russian roulette with her knife launcher."
MaleSuicide="%o played Russian roulette with his knife launcher."

[DTX8KnifeMGLaunchedHead]
DeathStrings=("%k ran out of bullets, but %kh small knife pierced %o's retina.","%o stared down the wrong end of %k's MG, should've seen the ballistic knife poking %vh eye.","%k had one last surprise for %o, a ballistic knife to the dome.")
SimpleKillString="PKMA - X8 Ballistic Knife"
DeathString="%k's knife defied all odds to enter %o's vodka-blurred eye."
FemaleSuicide="%o's PKM bayonet gave her a surprise."
MaleSuicide="%o's PKM bayonet gave him a surprise."

[DTXMV500MG]
DeathStrings=("%o was gunned down by %k's XMB-500.","%k filled %o with XMB-500 lead.","%o was shredded by %k's XMB-500 minigun.","%o was at the business end of %k's minigun.")
DeathString="%o was gunned down by %k's XMB-500."
FemaleSuicide="%o was rejected by her own minigun."
MaleSuicide="%o was rejected by his own minigun."

[DTXMV500MGHead]
DeathStrings=("%k's smart minigun blew %o's brain.","%o's head was replaced with %k's XMB-500 bullets.","%o lost %vh head in a fight with %k's XMB-500.","%k's XMB-500 smashed rounds through %o's cranium.")
DeathString="%k's smart minigun blew %o's brain."
FemaleSuicide="%o minigunned her own head off."
MaleSuicide="%o minigunned his own head off."

[DTXMVCHEAT]
DeathStrings=("%o was gunned down by %k's XMB-500.","%k filled %o with XMB-500 lead.","%o was shredded by %k's XMB-500 minigun.","%o was at the business end of %k's minigun.")
FemaleSuicides=("%o forgot to read her XMB instruction manual.","%o broke her wrists with a malfunctioning XMB-500.","%o tried firing an uncontrollable XMB-500.")
MaleSuicides=("%o forgot to read his XMB instruction manual.","%o broke his wrists with a malfunctioning XMB-500.","%o tried firing an uncontrollable XMB-500.")
DeathString="%o was gunned down by %k's XMB-500."
FemaleSuicide="%o forgot to read her XMB instruction manual."
MaleSuicide="%o forgot to read his XMB instruction manual."

[DTZX98Gauss]
DeathStrings=("%o was gaussed to the point of no return by %k's Reaper.","%k opened several wormholes into %o's torso.","%o was ferried to the afterlife, %k's gauss powered reaper helped speed it along.","%k took %o's soul using newfound gauss technology.")
DeathString="%o was perforated by %k's ZX-98 fire."
FemaleSuicide="OH NO YOU SOMEHOW SHOT YOURSELF. WHYYYY."
MaleSuicide="OH GOD YOU SHOT YOURSELF. HOW DID YOU DO THAT."

[DTZX98GaussHead]
DeathStrings=("%o went dark on %k due to having %vh mind blown by the Reaper.","%k's Reaper punched a fist-sized hole into %o's tiny head.","%o's mind couldn't handle the gauss tech used by %k's Reaper.","%k popped off on %o, taking his head off %vh shoulders.")
DeathString="%k badgered %o's head off."
FemaleSuicide="%o routed herself."
MaleSuicide="%o routed himself."

[DTZX98Rifle]
DeathStrings=("%o feared %k's Reaper and was sent to the great beyond.","%k harvested %o's soul and organs with the Reaper.","%o donated %vh bullet filled organs to %k's Reaper for science.","%k's Reaper collected %o's life with a hailstorm of lead.")
DeathString="%o was perforated by %k's ZX-98 fire."
FemaleSuicide="OH NO YOU SOMEHOW SHOT YOURSELF. WHYYYY."
MaleSuicide="OH GOD YOU SHOT YOURSELF. HOW DID YOU DO THAT."

[DTZX98RifleHead]
DeathStrings=("The soul and brains in %o's head was freed thanks to %k.","%o put two bullets in %k's eyes, %ke had no drachma to pay the ferryman.","%k's gray matter was reaped due to %o's Reaper.","%o's Reaper took %k's head off with a couple of bullets.")
DeathString="%k badgered %o's head off."
FemaleSuicide="%o routed herself."
MaleSuicide="%o routed himself."

[DT_HB4Bolt]
DeathStrings=("%k deadened %o's arms, then their legs, and finally, their heart.","%o was stunned long enough for them to be murdered by %k.","%k fried %o to a nice, crispy, well done with a stun bolt.","%o got blasted to bits by %k's grenade blaster.")
SimpleKillString="HB4 Electric Bolt"
DeathString="%k plugged %o into an X-007 bolt."
FemaleSuicide="%o brought a capacitor to a wall fight."
MaleSuicide="%o brought a capacitor to a wall fight."

[DT_RadGrenadeDirect]
DeathStrings=("%k whipped a rad grenade at %o's face.","%o took %k's explosive rad grenade to the face.")
DeathString="%k whipped a rad grenade at %o's face."
FemaleSuicide="%o beat the walls with her grenade like a lunatic."
MaleSuicide="%o beat the walls with his grenade like a lunatic."

[DT_SHADRACHGrenadeRadius]
DeathStrings=("%k forced evolved %o into a radioactive mess.","%o got disoriented and died into %k's radioactive chaff cloud.","%k made %o sniff their green cloud, warping their DNA strands into a Dali painting.","%o was redirected into %k's radioactive mist and got lost.","%k scrambled %o so much, that they became a pile of green goo.")
DeathString="%o unexpectedly died to %k's SHADRACH chaff grenade."
FemaleSuicide="%o shouldn't huff in that radioactive cloud, whatever gets them high amirite?"
MaleSuicide="%o tried to redirect incoming missiles into the cloud, but they got lost instead."

[DT_SHADRACHPlague]
DeathStrings=("%o force evolved into a corpse after being exposed to %k's virus.","%k took notes while %o succumbed to lethal radiation poisoning.","%o ran out of time and became irradiated to death by %k.","%k turned %o into a radioactive beacon to guide lost ships home.")
SimpleKillString="SRK-205 Irradiation"
DeathString="%k's radiation overdose was too much for %o."
FemaleSuicide="%o irradiated herself."
MaleSuicide="%o irradiated himself."

[E5Pickup]
PickupMessage="You picked up the E-5 'ViPeR'."

[E5PlasmaRifle]
WeaponModes=((ModeName="Series Pulse"),(ModeName="Multi Pulse"),(ModeName="Sniper Pulse"))
ManualLines=("Series mode fires a continuous stream of high damage projectiles, which gain damage over range.|Multi mode fires three projectiles simultaneously in a spread pattern, mimicking a shotgun.","Projects a hitscan beam with almost no recoil but low damage output.",)
Description="Following the success of the E23 Plasma Rifle, Frontier Tech began another prototype, originally it was to be a modular system and an improvement to the original model.  But lack of finances among other technical issues forced the company to make drastic alterations.  It took a lot of work, but soon, the E5 Advanced Science Pistol or 'ASP' was born.  Firing the same variable high-power plasma bolts like the E23, it comes in a more portable package at the cost of losing a powerful single shot bolt and night vision scope. Instead, it comes with a pop up reflex sight, a requested change from the various light infantry sectors across the galaxy, the E5 should do well during the next year if all goes to plan."
ItemName="E-5 'AsP' Plasma Pistol"

[E5WeaponParamsClassic]
ClassicParams.WeaponModes=((ModeName="Series Pulse"),(ModeName="Multi Pulse"),(ModeName="Sniper Pulse"))

[E5WeaponParamsRealistic]
RealisticParams.WeaponModes=((ModeName="Series Pulse"),(ModeName="Multi Pulse"),(ModeName="Sniper Pulse"))

[FM14Pickup]
PickupMessage="You picked up the FM14 Pitbull Blunderbuss."

[FM14Shotgun]
WeaponModes=((ModeName="Single Fire"),(ModeName="Burst"),(ModeName="Auto"))
ManualLines=("Long-ranged pump-action shotgun fire. Slug rounds and high damage, but relatively slow fire rate. Sustained damage output is lower than that of shorter-ranged shotguns.","Loads a Flak shell. Once loaded, the Flak shell can be fired, generating an array of shrapnel when it explodes. This shrapnel can poisen the target and deal damage over time","Has a melee attack. The damage of the attack increases the longer altfire is held, up to 1.5 seconds for maximum damage output. As a blunt attack, has lower base damage compared to bayonets but inflicts a short-duration blinding effect when striking. This attack inflicts more damage from behind.||As a shotgun, has poor penetration.||Most effective at medium range.")
Description="With each successful project Black and Woods releases, the more funding they get to go back and revisit some of their older projects, the FM14 'Gnasher' Blunderbuss being one of them.  Originally designed as a high powered hunting shotgun chambered in 8 gauge slugs, it was left abandoned due to not enough interest in the project. Now with their latest Pitbull design seeing widespread adoption by several armed forces across the galaxy, the Gnasher has been brought back and improved. Better rifling and the ability to fire 'flaktox' grenades; specialized grenades that unleash poisonous darts that fragment out like flak shrapnel.  Expected projections are looking good, especially with the upcoming siege on the Cryon capital on Eden-25."
ItemName="FM14 Pitbull Blunderbuss"

[GASCPickup]
PickupMessage="You picked up the Gaucho and Stallion"

[GASCPistol]
WeaponModes=((ModeName="Burst of Four"),(ModeName="Burst"),(ModeName="Semi-Auto"),(ModeName="Full Auto"))
ManualLines=("High Fire Rate Burst Pistol and Dagger. 4 Round Burst. Low Recoil.","Prepares a bludgeoning attack, which will be executed upon release. The damage of the attack increases the longer altfire is held, up to 1.5 seconds for maximum damage output. This attack inflicts more damage from behind.","The Weapon Function key toggles a laser sight, which reduces the spread of the weapon's hipfire, but exposes the user's position to the enemy. This laser sight makes the MD24 a strong choice for dual wielding.||Effective at close range.")
Description="An interesting pair of weapons, a pistol and a dagger.  The GP-X22 'Gaucho' is no stranger to the public, a burst fire pistol that was supposed to be in the civilian market for its self-defense prowess. It didn't pan out as there were more deadly options to protect the user, but it did find use in the hands of various scouts across the universe. The dagger, however, is an enigma all on it's own, speculated that it came from the 1800's, wielded by a member of Tchernobog's clan before one of his own turned on him and killed him.  Known as the 'Stallion,' it has been paired with the Gaucho to become a deadly duo in CQB."
ItemName="Gaucho and Stallion"

[GASCPistolWeaponParamsClassic]
ClassicParams.WeaponModes=((ModeName="Burst of Four"),,(ModeName="Semi-Auto"),(ModeName="Full Auto"))

[GASCPistolWeaponParamsRealistic]
RealisticParams.WeaponModes=((ModeName="Semi-Auto"),(ModeName="Burst of Four"),(ModeName="Semi-Auto"),(ModeName="Full Auto"))

[GASCPistolWeaponParamsTactical]
TacticalParams.WeaponModes=((ModeName="Semi-Auto"),(ModeName="Burst of Four"),(ModeName="Semi-Auto"),(ModeName="Full Auto"))

[HB4GrenadeBlaster]
WeaponModes=((ModeName="Semi"),(ModeName="Burst"),(ModeName="Auto"))
ManualLines=("High-powered Blaster fire. Recoil is high.")
Description="Maramu Tek might've joined the war against the Skrith late, but their arrival couldn't have come at a better time after the Cryon attack on Neo York.  The situation of having tough armored warriors in an urban situation full of civilians was tough and delicate, if it weren't for Maramu Tek's first offering of the HB4 Grenade Blaster, things would've gone awry very fast. Firing compact stun bolts akin to the Electrobolts that MK781 fires, they disabled the Cyron's intricate wiring systems quickly, and the flash temporarily scrambled their visual processing units, making it handy to have. Neo York was saved while the HB4 went on to perform in situations similar to the Cryon crisis."
ItemName="HB4 Electro Grenade Blaster"

[HB4Pickup]
PickupMessage="You picked up the HB4 Electro Grenade Blaster."

[HKMKSpecPickup]
PickupMessage="You picked up the HKM-26 pistol."

[HKMKSpecPistol]
WeaponModes=((ModeName="Semi"),(ModeName="Burst"),(ModeName="Auto"))
ManualLines=("Semi-automatic .45 fire. Moderate damage and fire rate.","Alt fire is a potent close range shotgun attachment.","Weapon Function attaches a suppressor, reducing the flash and reducing the noise output.")
Description="There's always trouble on the homefront, no matter if it's peaceful or a war is raging on. Criminals are running rampant like the infamous pirate Var Dehidra and other ne'er do-wells, and while there are plenty of personal protection weapons, not a lot can pack a punch.  One such exception is the HKM-26 Assault Pistol, an upgrade kit to the original H&K MK23 which not only allows the use for the .45HVAP rounds, but comes with a miniature shotgun mounted on the underside of the pistol. The idea is to penetrate through whatever armor the bad guys are wearing before putting them down with some double 00 buckshot. It's worked on some of the most dangerous criminals, but as always; Var Dehidra has managed to elude such a fate."
ItemName="HKM-26 Assault Pistol"

[HydraBazooka]
WeaponModes=((ModeName="HV Rockets"),(ModeName="Guided Rockets"),(ModeName="Auto"))
ManualLines=("Fires a rocket. These rockets have an arming delay and will ricochet off surfaces when unarmed.|In Laser mode, the rocket flies directly to the point of aim.","Builds up between One and Six rockets to be shot. The beep indicates the addition of a rocket into the charged shot. Upon fired, the rockets will cone around the target in the shape of a hexagon, to ensure the rockets dont colide and enclose the target. These rockets are affected by the guidance laser.","Weapon Function Toggles the guidance laser. With the guidance laser active, rockets will fly towards the point indicated by the laser at any given time.|The Robotic Arm enables the weapon to be reloaded while aiming down sights. This reload will be much faster than standard reload and can be used in a defensive position")
Description="Many centuries have gone by since the introduction of the rocket, though the method has remained the same of launching explosive ordinance through tubes, the tech has improved tenfold.  Now as the second skrith wars rage on, the pinnacle of rocket launchers has reached its pinnacle with the M-11X ''Hydra'' MRL.  With 6 barrels ready to launch rockets, it is a multi-purpose launcher, able to lock on to anything, or it can fire them unguided or even in a swooping manner to get over obstacles.  Normally the user would have to load the rockets by hand, taking valuable time in the battlefield, but the Hydra comes with a Hytek arm that automatically pulls the ammo and loads it into the chamber without the user's input whatsoever."
ItemName="M11-X Hydra MRL"

[HydraPickup]
PickupMessage="You picked up the Hydra missile launcher."

[MJ51Carbine]
WeaponModes=((ModeName="Semi-Auto"),(ModeName="Burst Fire"),(ModeName="Auto"),(ModeName="Automatic"))
Description="MJ51 Carbine"
ItemName="MJ51 Carbine"

